OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPerhaps a few brighter spells
OL,6,Fat first this morning, though cloud
OL,7,Fwill thicken through the afternoon
OL,8,Fbringing outbreaks of rain, heavy and
OL,9,Fmore persistent at times, feeling
OL,10,Frather chilly and unpleasant. Winds
OL,11,Fremain light through the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain possible tonight,
OL,14,Fwith clearer spells developing towards
OL,15,Fdawn, allowing temperatures to dip
OL,16,Fwith a touch of frost. Strong winds
OL,17,Ftowards the coast at first add to the
OL,18,Fchill.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
