OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA bright start to the new
OL,6,Fweek, with plenty of sunshine
OL,7,Favailable, though feeling chilly.
OL,8,FThough turning wet and windy into the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FRemaining chilly and rather damp. Rain
OL,13,Fpersists on Tuesday, turning heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes with possible snow over the
OL,15,Fhills. Rain returns on Wednesday
OL,16,Fbefore turning drier into Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
